    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "im kinda busy with work rn and the clinic is like a 45 min drive away so i really dont wanna deal with a waiting room if i dont have to. it doesnt look that bad, just like a circle. if i just take some ibuprofen for the fever and put some clotrimazole on it for a few days, do you think that would be enough to clear it up? i dont want to make a big deal out of nothing.",
